  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">11th EDF Support to the Caribbean Court of Justice - Procurement Component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This project will foster CARICOM citizens&#xbf; participation in, and access to, justice systems through the following specific outcomes: 1.Strengthened functions and outreach of the Caribbean Court of Justice; 2.An established and operationalised Caribbean Community Administrative Tribunal; 3.Modernised legal education (a new curriculum for the region&#xbf;s law schools). Its main focus will be the facilitation of all required procurement to equip both the Court and the Tribunal with the technology needed to effectively carry out their respective mandates, as well as to run a tailored communication and awareness programme, and to enable the Council of Legal Education&#xbf;s curriculum reform efforts for the region&#xbf;s law schools.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
